    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맘에 들어?",
      "en": "Do you like it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "저날 꽤나 맘에 들었나 본데 ㅋ",
      "en": "Looks like you really liked that day, ㅋ"
    },
    {
