    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "스무살은 아무리 찾아도 없는겨",
      "en": "But no matter how much I searched, there wasn't one for twenty."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서",
      "en": "So..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 개사함",
      "en": "I rewrote the lyrics."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "예쁜나이 스물스물스물",
      "en": "\"Pretty age, twenty-twenty-twenty.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러면서",
      "en": "Like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "스물",
      "en": "\"Twenty.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔가 단어가 웃기다",
      "en": "It's kind of a funny word."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "스물~",
      "en": "Twenty~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 아직 생일이 안지나서",
      "en": "But since my birthday hasn't passed yet..."
