    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 걔 팔 몰래 치면서",
      "en": "I secretly nudged their arm."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "화면 보라고 화면",
      "en": "\"Look at the screen!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러다가 안하길래",
      "en": "But they still wouldn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 걔 멘트 대신 해주고",
      "en": "So I said their lines for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그때 엄마가",
      "en": "Afterwards, my mom said..."
